      "introduction": "This page explains declaration identity and the source contracts that use it. The shared contracts include source APIs other than `query_symbols`.\n\nFor `query_symbols`, `READ_SOURCE.candidateRef` checks the issued snapshot. It does not reacquire a stale exact reference. A fresh `RUN` can reacquire an exact reference after current compiler identity checks. It does not refresh retained rows or source snapshots. [Query forms](/reference/api#actions) defines the current public actions."
